    "created_at": "2023-04-24T16:51:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-24T16:51:23Z",
    "body": "> So for remove an element the hide popover algorithm is invoked with false for throwing exceptions. Could you elaborate on why it would nevertheless throw an exception here?\r\n\r\nThat part may not throw an exception, but the caller (Step 5.1) https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-hidepopover would in the next step throw the exception (Step 5.2) (looks like we have nested \"hide the popover\" here).",
