    "created_at": "2023-04-24T18:04:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-24T18:05:30Z",
    "body": "Ok I understand now, the WebKit behavior of throwing an exception on hidePopover is expected and matches the spec.\r\nThe WPT will be updated to throw an exception here: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/39654\r\n\r\nChromium had diverging behavior which is being corrected here: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4461952",
